# The cave hauler with its knuckle drive on its BACK (mechanics 3a, part sides;
# the limestone caves' `over` part), turned the way tours/part_sides.tour turns
# the bonelands one, whose drive is on its left.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/part_sides_cave.tour --seed=7 --realm=underground --hour=11
coast calm
walk -1,0 1.6
wait 0.6
spawn hauler@135
wait 0.8
shot 01-the-cave-hauler-works-with-its-back with mob:hauler,land:limestone_caves
